l into view. Click the number to open the pull request.","The Pull requests section in the sidebar lists your own open pull requests and those of the branches you have looked at. It starts collapsed.","Branches also show their merged pull request, marked with a merge symbol, when they have no open one.","Pull request links appear right away, also after restarting Northspline, and are refreshed in the background.","Branch pull requests also work with Forgejo.","Loading more pull requests no longer repeats the first page, and a finished load is no longer lost when another one starts.","The toolbar shows a renamed tab's name, together with its group's name."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.26-27","version":"0.1.0-beta.26"},{"assets":[{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":15653368,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.25-26-linux-x86_64.AppImage","format":"AppImage","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"a717f443cd79c34b3471b35d62a81536c9dd3bd68b2cc876ff22c0ab1ebb7f3f","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.25-26/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.25-26-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":16081309,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.25-26-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"651a6072aabbba2edce6024d1b732ee12368a15832c75d3bb421f0aab78a3ead","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.25-26/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.25-26-linux-x86_64.tar.gz"},{"architecture":"arm64","bytes":17411841,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.25-26-macos-arm64.dmg","format":"dmg","minimum_system":"macOS 13.0 and Git 2.39","platform":"macos","sha256":"e40b8f2d880d88e298b7164bf14882d3e73882ac90e11fd2958c766afafd8272","update_signature":"/0y/1cDogXPIWvOHjiX+sZ/MfEHLJVN41y1hjq5ssHtj6lGipfgmd2BJLnka0/C7+Fh4bdkKvliJt0EvRzgqBg==","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.25-26/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.25-26-macos-arm64.dmg"},{"a